sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Visitor
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>RegisterPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>RegisterBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>RegisterController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: register as a Customer or Interior Designer
  UI->>B: POST /api/auth/register (JWT)
  B->>C: register(RegisterRequest request)
  alt role not CUSTOMER/ID, or email taken
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 / 409 + fieldErrors error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>User: emailTaken()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C->>User: save()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: UserSummary
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end